{"h":"<p>这是一个多次放大图像、逐渐改变比例和参数的工作流程。</p><h2>版本</h2><p><em>短</em>版本使用一个特殊的节点<a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">冲击包</a>.</p><p>旧版本并没有更好或更差，但它们很长且扩展。它们提供更多控制，允许调整中间步骤。他们要求<a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">WAS 节点套件</a>.</p><h2>安装和依赖</h2><ol><li><p>安装<a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">冲击包</a>自定义节点（<u>应该是最新的版本，如 12.02.2024</u>);</p></li><li><p>（可选）安装<a href=\"https://github.com/receyuki/comfyui-prompt-reader-node\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">SD提示阅读器</a>自定义节点；</p></li><li><p>下载并打开此工作流程；</p></li></ol><h2>推荐资源</h2><p>跨版本节点中选择的所有资源的完整列表：</p><p><strong>VAE</strong>: <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/sd-vae-ft-mse-original/blob/main/vae-ft-mse-840000-ema-pruned.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">vae-ft-mse-840000-ema-修剪</a>。标准，推荐了解更多详情。</p><p><strong><u>现实：</u></strong></p><p><strong>标清型号</strong>: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/25694?modelVersionId=134065\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">超现实主义</a>。如何替代：用任何现实模型。</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/8030?modelVersionId=101080\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">模拟疯狂</a>。如何替代：使用任何真实感模型。</p><p><strong>升级型号</strong>: <a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-NMKD-Superscale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xNMKD 超大规模</a>。替代方法：下载<a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-ESRGAN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xESRGAN</a>（或从Automatic1111 获取）。</p><p><strong>文本倒装</strong>: <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Nerfgun3/bad_prompt/blob/main/bad_prompt_version2.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">bad_prompt_version2</a>。降低不寻常的成分的重量。</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/4629?modelVersionId=5637\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">深负</a>。使用 16T 进行基础生成，使用 2T 进行高级生成。</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/116230?modelVersionId=125849\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">坏手5</a>。使用0.8重量。</p><p>如何替换文本倒装：跳过即可。</p><p><strong><u>动漫：</u></strong></p><p><strong>标清型号</strong>: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/44165\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">山茶花混合</a>。如何替代：用任何动漫模型。</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/105955/onlyanime-or\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">仅限动漫</a>。如何替代：用任何动漫模型。</p><p><strong>高档型号</strong>: <a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-NMKD-YandereNeo-XL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xNMKD YandereNeo XL</a>。替代方法：下载<a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-UltraSharp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4x 超锐利</a>.</p><p><strong>文本倒装</strong>: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/7808/easynegative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">简单负数</a>. <u>推荐。</u></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/16993\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">坏手v4</a>。仅当手不重要时才使用。否则使用<a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/116230?modelVersionId=125849\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">坏手5</a>（但这可能会改变整个情况）。</p><p>如何替换文本倒装：跳过即可。</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/Postpos/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">查看我的其他工作流程</a></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>It's a workflow to upscale image several times, gradually changing scale and parameters.</p><h2>Versions</h2><p><em>Short</em>version uses a special node from<a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Impact pack</a>.</p><p>Older versions are not better or worse, but they are long and expanded. They provide more control, allowing to tune intermediate steps. They requre<a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">WAS Node Suite</a>.</p><h2>Installation and dependencies</h2><ol><li><p>Install<a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Impact pack</a>custom nodes (<u>should be a newest possible version, as for 12.02.2024</u>);</p></li><li><p>(optional) Install<a href=\"https://github.com/receyuki/comfyui-prompt-reader-node\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">SD Prompt Reader</a>custom node;</p></li><li><p>Download and open this workflow;</p></li></ol><h2>Recommended resources</h2><p>Complete list of all resources chosen in nodes across versions:</p><p><strong>VAE</strong>: <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/sd-vae-ft-mse-original/blob/main/vae-ft-mse-840000-ema-pruned.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">vae-ft-mse-840000-ema-pruned</a>. Standard, recommended for more details.</p><p><strong><u>Realistic:</u></strong></p><p><strong>SD models</strong>: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/25694?modelVersionId=134065\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">epiCRealism</a>. How to substitute: with any realistic model.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/8030?modelVersionId=101080\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Analog Madness</a>. How to substitute: with any photorealistic model.</p><p><strong>Upscaler model</strong>: <a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-NMKD-Superscale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xNMKD Superscale</a>. How to substitute: download<a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-ESRGAN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xESRGAN</a>(or take it from Automatic1111).</p><p><strong>Textual Inversions</strong>: <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Nerfgun3/bad_prompt/blob/main/bad_prompt_version2.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">bad_prompt_version2</a>. Lower the weight for unusual compositions.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/4629?modelVersionId=5637\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Deep Negative</a>. Use 16T for base generation, and 2T for upscale.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/116230?modelVersionId=125849\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">bad-Hands-5</a>. Use with 0.8 weight.</p><p>How to substitute Textual Inversions: just skip.</p><p><strong><u>Anime:</u></strong></p><p><strong>SD models</strong>: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/44165\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">CamelliaMix</a>. How to substitute: with any anime model.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/105955/onlyanime-or\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">OnlyAnime</a>. How to substitute: with any anime model.</p><p><strong>Upscale Model</strong>: <a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-NMKD-YandereNeo-XL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xNMKD YandereNeo XL</a>. How to substitute: download<a href=\"https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-UltraSharp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">4xUltraSharp</a>.</p><p><strong>Textual Inversions</strong>: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/7808/easynegative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">EasyNegative</a>. <u>Recommended.</u></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/16993\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">badhandv4</a>. Only use if hands are not important. Otherwise use<a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/116230?modelVersionId=125849\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">bad-Hands-5</a>(but it might change the whole picture).</p><p>How to substitute Textual Inversions: just skip.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/Postpos/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Check out my other workflows</a></p>"}}